# GitHub Enterprise (Cloud or Server) - Local POC Token
#
# Copy to "github-token.txt" (no .example suffix). That file is
# gitignored and MUST NEVER be committed. LOCAL POC USE ONLY.
#
# Recommended: a fine-grained personal access token, or a GitHub App
# installation token if you have one set up, scoped to only the
# organization(s)/repositories you intend to exercise in the POC.
# Production deployments MUST replace this with a GitHub App +
# installation-token flow (Section 12/49) rather than a long-lived PAT.
#
# Format: the raw token value only.
REPLACE_WITH_REAL_GITHUB_TOKEN
